                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "d89c086d-6d30-3ad1-b891-c847784045e7",
                        "entry_id": "d8688663-f750-3eae-bb8e-cf56aa54d3ca",
                        "glosses": [
                            "истор. в России до 1917 г. — женск. к вольнослушатель; лицо женского пола, допущенное к занятиям и экзаменам в высшем учебном заведении без зачисления в число студентов"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f050071c-1699-48f2-aae5-6381b3e9756e",
                                "sense_id": "d89c086d-6d30-3ad1-b891-c847784045e7",
                                "text": "Султана не экзаменовалась: она вольнослушательница. Она только «присутствовала» и тотчас после экзаменов исчезла куда-то, захватив перчатки Шепталовой и зонтик Ольги."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "5ff73cd4-06cb-48d1-bad4-bfdfb204a43d",
                        "source_entry_id": "d8688663-f750-3eae-bb8e-cf56aa54d3ca",
                        "source_sense_id": "d89c086d-6d30-3ad1-b891-c847784045e7",
                        "target_lang_word": "auditor",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "auditor",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bf34d04d-f8e9-3b86-a33d-432fbe86ed96",
                                        "entry_id": "3bf89691-232f-3613-a4d3-a56aef533905",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One who audits bookkeeping accounts."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e2c56729-8ff7-3d6e-84b7-238dea63c2e5",
                                        "entry_id": "3bf89691-232f-3613-a4d3-a56aef533905",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In many jurisdictions, an elected or appointed public official in charge of the public accounts; a comptroller."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "828b2cee-e927-35e9-8bef-6ee6176d3a80",
                                        "entry_id": "3bf89691-232f-3613-a4d3-a56aef533905",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One who audits an academic course; who attends the lectures but does not earn academic credit."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "893a38b2-a047-349c-9b91-22ff5b4ab859",
                                        "entry_id": "3bf89691-232f-3613-a4d3-a56aef533905",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One who listens, typically as a member of an audience."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "rare"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0bd76ce5-8330-439a-8a05-60771e8d83ec",
                                                "sense_id": "893a38b2-a047-349c-9b91-22ff5b4ab859",
                                                "text": "There is another of better notice, and whispered through the world with some attention; credulous and vulgar auditors readily believing it, and more judicious and distinctive heads not altogether rejecting it."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fd77639d-a904-4564-8b7d-b0592ccdbe14",
                                                "sense_id": "893a38b2-a047-349c-9b91-22ff5b4ab859",
                                                "text": "Thus (as you will see with half an eye, my wise little auditors) these good old dames had fallen into a strange perplexity."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9afe7dee-9de7-4401-bb21-4b27371ccf0d",
                                                "sense_id": "893a38b2-a047-349c-9b91-22ff5b4ab859",
                                                "text": "Sampson's tongue was still flying with rapidity, as if his auditors had not been void of a number, while Mr. Alboni and Natalie were holding a consultation aside."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ea0b1e7a-b26c-4d34-a1d7-cc5ca993d56e",
                                                "sense_id": "893a38b2-a047-349c-9b91-22ff5b4ab859",
                                                "text": "As we crossed the hall the telephone-bell rang, and we were the involuntary auditors of Professor Challenger's end of the ensuing dialogue."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7191255f-270b-3438-b69a-90b4ceeacc5b",
                                        "entry_id": "3bf89691-232f-3613-a4d3-a56aef533905",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One trained to perform spiritual guidance procedures."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "6f78bf62-3f55-49b0-b19a-3ef85c14df07",
                        "source_entry_id": "d8688663-f750-3eae-bb8e-cf56aa54d3ca",
                        "source_sense_id": "d89c086d-6d30-3ad1-b891-c847784045e7",
